LICENCE BOUNDARY NOTICE

This MIT licence covers the SWOS code, schemas, contracts, specifications and
templates in this repository only.

It does NOT cover:

  * Third-party scholarly sources retrieved at runtime. Those remain under the
    licence of their publisher. See governance/source-rights-policy.md.
  * Example corpora contributed under a separate data licence. Each corpus
    directory under examples/ carries its own DATA-LICENCE.md.
  * Discipline ontologies derived from third-party controlled vocabularies,
    which carry their own attribution files.

SWOS never redistributes source full text. It redistributes metadata,
identifiers, provenance records and rights-cleared excerpts only.
